{
 "_doc": "Ten ready-made creature designs built on the newer creature types (hyena, turtle, beetle, griffin, phoenix, centipede, slime, mushroom, mimic, crocodile). Not wired into any game: a game can copy an entry into its own looks table. Each entry is a full creature look (creature spec for avatar-3d/js/creatures.js createCreature, plus voice and speech sections from the shared character schema) and suggested level and attributes. Moved here from Emberveil, where they had been added as tavern hires by mistake. 2026-10-03: eight `bl_*` entries are Bannerline's send units (prototypes/bannerline, PLAN §14), on the new types tuskback/ghoul/bone_colossus/crow/thornback plus golem/wolf/saber_cat looks; `game` names the game that uses them, and the same looks are in library/data/defaults.json as `bl_<id>`.",
